<title>VENEZUELA: Chronology of Venezuela's CANTV share offering.</title>
<headline>Chronology of Venezuela's CANTV share offering.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chronology of Venezuelan telephone company CANTV's global share offering as detailed by Venezuelan Investment Fund President Alberto Poletto is the following:</p>
<p>* Oct 31, Nov 1 - Pre-marketing in the United States</p>
<p>* Nov 1 - Start of Venezuelan roadshow</p>
<p>* Nov 4-8 - European roadshow</p>
<p>* Nov 4-21 - Book building of international tranche</p>
<p>* Nov 5-15 - Book building of Venezuela's minority tranche</p>
<p>* Nov 5-19 - Book building of Venezuelan institutional tranche</p>
<p>* Nov 11-20 - U.S. roadshow</p>
<p>* Nov 27 - Closure, payment</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
